<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport" />
    <title>Performance Analyzer - Problem Statement</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
        :root { --p-blue: #2563eb; --text: #1a1a1a; --border: #cbd5e1; }
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #ffffff; overflow: hidden; }
        .slide-container { width: 1280px; height: 720px; background: #ffffff; position: relative; padding: 60px 80px; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .header { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .title-text { margin: 0; font-size: 52px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
        .separator { width: 100%; height: 2px; background-color: var(--border); margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
        .bullet-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }
        .bullet-icon { margin-right: 18px; color: var(--p-blue); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
        .bullet-text { flex: 1; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="slide-container">
        <div class="header"><h1 class="title-text">Problem Statement</h1></div>
        <div class="separator"></div>
        <div class="bullet-item"><i class="fas fa-circle bullet-icon"></i><div class="bullet-text">Student performance records are usually maintained manually. Different records are stored in separate files, making it difficult to manage.</div></div>
        <div class="bullet-item"><i class="fas fa-circle bullet-icon"></i><div class="bullet-text">Marks, attendance, and test scores are not connected. Faculty need to check multiple records to understand student progress.</div></div>
        <div class="bullet-item"><i class="fas fa-circle bullet-icon"></i><div class="bullet-text">Manual calculations consume more time. There is also a high chance of errors in report preparation.</div></div>
        <div class="bullet-item"><i class="fas fa-circle bullet-icon"></i><div class="bullet-text">There is no proper system for analytics. Existing methods do not provide charts, reports, or AI-based predictions.</div></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
